# Where the desktop app drops files it could not write straight into the
# repo (it does this whenever the bridge is offline). Copies of real
# source files, at the wrong depth — so tsc tried to compile them and
# reported "Cannot find module '../../lib/supabase'" against a file that
# is not part of the project. Excluded in tsconfig.json too; this keeps
# them out of commits.
